1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,617
Same request, same Claude.

2
00:00:01,617 --> 00:00:01,927
Left:

3
00:00:01,927 --> 00:00:02,674
two minutes.

4
00:00:02,674 --> 00:00:03,047
Right:

5
00:00:03,047 --> 00:00:06,964
twenty-three minutes, with a skill that's blowing up on GitHub:

6
00:00:06,964 --> 00:00:07,710
Taste Skill.

7
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:09,285
Its promise:

8
00:00:09,285 --> 00:00:12,898
no more websites that scream "AI".

9
00:00:12,898 --> 00:00:13,960
I checked.

10
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:15,145
The request:

11
00:00:15,145 --> 00:00:18,761
a homepage for a neighborhood café in Casablanca.

12
00:00:18,761 --> 00:00:22,450
Café Nour, homemade pastries, open seven to eight.

13
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:26,373
Without the skill, Claude delivers in two minutes sixteen.

14
00:00:26,373 --> 00:00:31,121
Big serif headline with one gold italic word, darkened photo, little badges.

15
00:00:31,121 --> 00:00:31,559
Pretty…

16
00:00:31,559 --> 00:00:34,120
but it's the look you spot in one second.

17
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:35,208
Scroll down:

18
00:00:35,208 --> 00:00:36,389
a customer review.

19
00:00:36,389 --> 00:00:40,393
"The best flat white in Maârif." That customer doesn't exist.

20
00:00:40,393 --> 00:00:41,575
Claude made it up.

21
00:00:41,575 --> 00:00:45,710
Same for "one hundred percent of pastries baked from five a.m."

22
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:47,088
With the skill:

23
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:48,597
twenty-three minutes.

24
00:00:48,597 --> 00:00:51,614
A plain headline that says what and where.

25
00:00:51,614 --> 00:00:53,770
A real trade photo, no filter.

26
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:54,809
Why so long?

27
00:00:54,809 --> 00:00:59,734
The skill opens the page in a real browser, rereads the copy, measures contrast,

28
00:00:59,734 --> 00:01:00,781
and forces fixes.

29
00:01:00,781 --> 00:01:02,628
One issue was left at the end:

30
00:01:02,628 --> 00:01:04,290
a contrast check on mobile.

31
00:01:04,590 --> 00:01:05,058
Result:

32
00:01:05,058 --> 00:01:07,129
three screens instead of seven.

33
00:01:07,129 --> 00:01:11,137
One hundred sixty-five words instead of six hundred seventy.

34
00:01:11,137 --> 00:01:12,340
Zero fake reviews.

35
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:13,270
The cost:

36
00:01:13,270 --> 00:01:16,910
two and a half times the tokens, ten times the time.

37
00:01:17,210 --> 00:01:17,939
My verdict:

38
00:01:17,939 --> 00:01:20,920
it doesn't make the page prettier by default.

39
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:22,179
It makes it honest.

40
00:01:22,179 --> 00:01:24,233
For a real business, I keep it.

41
00:01:24,233 --> 00:01:26,750
For a quick mockup, you don't need it.

42
00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:27,749
To install:

43
00:01:27,749 --> 00:01:30,798
one command, npx skills add, then the repo name.

44
00:01:30,798 --> 00:01:33,085
You need Node twenty-two and Chrome.

45
00:01:33,085 --> 00:01:33,720
It's free.
